Package: escrow
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Escrow OS Team <team@escrow-os.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), systemd, util-linux, strace
Recommends: apparmor, git, llama.cpp
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: run AI agents as reversible transactions
 escrow runs an AI agent (or any command) on a copy-on-write overlay inside
 unprivileged user, mount and PID namespaces, with a seccomp filter, cgroup v2
 limits and a log of its network connections. Nothing it writes reaches your
 files until you review the diff and commit; discard throws it all away.
